title: Symplectic Stafford formalization
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite the repository and the
  accompanying Symplectic Stafford paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Albert
    given-names: Christopher
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4773-416X
repository-code: https://github.com/itpplasma/symplectic-stafford-formal
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the ordered semantic, filtered, and symplectic
  interfaces for the same-divisor programme. This development checkpoint
  does not claim the universal higher-dimensional theorem.
keywords:
  - symplectic quantization
  - Stafford conjecture
  - noncommutative algebra
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
